<title>USA: Judge to hear Marvel request for reprieve.</title>
<headline>Judge to hear Marvel request for reprieve.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A U.S. bankruptcy judge will hold a hearing Friday to consider a request by Marvel Entertainment Group Inc for a reprieve from a decision awarding control of the company to its bondholders.</p>
<p>In its request, Marvel said bondholder control would cause irreparable harm to its assets and creditors.</p>
<p>U.S. Bankruptcy Court Judge Helen Balick was expected to hold a hearing on Marvel's request this morning or very early this afternoon.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
